Final model:

find x: set{explicit} of int(1..5)
find y: set{explicit} of int(1..6)
find x#explicit_1: matrix indexed by [int(1..5)] of int(1..5)
find x#explicit_2: int(0..5)
find y#explicit_1: matrix indexed by [int(1..6)] of int(1..6)
find y#explicit_2: int(0..6)
find x#explicit_1#components_1: int(1..5)
find x#explicit_1#components_2: int(1..5)
find x#explicit_1#components_3: int(1..5)
find x#explicit_1#components_4: int(1..5)
find x#explicit_1#components_5: int(1..5)
